@startuml
title Sequence Diagram - UC05 Duyet va quyet dinh vong doi POI

actor "Admin / ContentAdmin" as Actor
participant "Presentation Layer\nWebAdminUI - PoiTable" as UI
participant "Business Logic Layer\nPoisController + PoiService" as Business
participant "Data Access Layer\nPoiRepository + DbContext" as DataAccess
database "Database" as Database

Actor -> UI: Chon POI va hanh dong vong doi
UI -> Business: Gui yeu cau duyet, tu choi hoac thanh toan
Business -> Business: Kiem tra vai tro quan ly noi dung
Business -> DataAccess: Doc POI hien tai
DataAccess -> Database: Doc trang thai POI
Database --> DataAccess: Tra POI
DataAccess --> Business: Tra du lieu
alt POI khong ton tai
  Business --> UI: Tra loi khong tim thay
  UI --> Actor: Hien thi thong bao
else Trang thai khong cho phep chuyen
  Business --> UI: Tra loi trang thai khong hop le
  UI --> Actor: Giu trang thai cu va hien thi loi
else Hanh dong hop le
  alt Duyet PendingReview
    Business -> Business: Chuyen sang Approved va chua active
  else Yeu cau thanh toan tu Approved
    Business -> Business: Chuyen sang PendingPayment
  else Tu choi PendingReview hoac Approved
    Business -> Business: Chuyen sang Rejected
  else Danh dau Paid hoac Waived
    Business -> Business: Chuyen sang Active va dat thoi han
  end
  Business -> DataAccess: Ghi trang thai moi
  DataAccess -> Database: Cap nhat POI
  Database --> DataAccess: Xac nhan
  DataAccess --> Business: Tra POI da cap nhat
  Business --> UI: Tra ket qua
  UI --> Actor: Cap nhat danh sach va trang thai cong khai
end
@enduml
